Good Morning,

Thank you for your interest in our company.  Just to be clear, we are a
Customs Broker & a Freight Forwarding Company but  we can assist you in
obtaining your continuous bond.  Before we can proceed,
Can you please send us the following information for verification
purposes: Articles
of Formation, IRS EIN letter (CP575), W-9, principal ID, and the list of
officers in your organization.  To provide this service, we require a Power
of Attorney authorizing us to file for your bond. The person signing this
authorization must be an officer of the company.  The premium for a
$50,000.00 bond is $500.00, plus a $75.00 filing fee and a $250.00 new
customer setup fee. Approval from the Surety Company will probably take
7-10 days once we submit the application.  Once approved, we will file the
bond with USCBP, usually within 24 hrs.  We expect payment before filing
with USCBP.  Let us know if you have any questions.
For more information about our company services, you can visit our website
at www.capitoenterprises.com

Kind regards,
*SALLY CAPITO*
C - 847-220-1137
www.capitoenterprises.com
E-MAIL:  sally@capitoenterprises.com
(FMC OTI# 023069NF)
*Please note Capito Enterprises, Inc. will be closed Thursday, November 26,
2026 for Thanksgiving. We will resume normal office hours Friday, November
27, 2027. Have a wonderful holiday!*


